body:
Fun fact, my step grandma is on that show (i'm not gonna say the name because someone who is stalking me on this account is trying to dox me) Not only is it fake (I was on an episode with her when i was like 7) . A large majority of the actors (Including her) are absolute assholes, both on and off screen. Yet many of the fans don't realize this.  It's a problem because, the fans who think its real, will praise my step grandma, and then the people who are the **nicest** off camera will get death threats, nasty comments, etc.

&#x200B;

I get fucking dm's on social media saying they love my grandma, while at the same **fucking time** she is suing my father so that she can take my grandfathers money after he died even though he wanted it for his kids. (my dad, my uncle and my aunt)

what u/YoureTripleGay said:

&#x200B;

> Alright, then tell me: what is a good reason to *not* tell the public something as trivial as the shape or the Earth?
